{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-10_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-10","title":"破碎溫室","storyCode":"13-12","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"86e2de358937e8eeab2d151020ed3ba7a756e083d74136dd9a662ce24089404d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我是幸運的人。\n在祖父沐浴於溫室的陽光中，捧著他最愛的花溘然離世前，他已經為我打點好了一切。\n我的餘生會如同我們共同期望的那樣，在鎮子裡這間小小的溫室安穩度過。\n直到他們的到來。\n我曾無比恐慌，恐慌自己的生活將被打破……\n但那個薩卡茲下了命令，我的工作依然是留在這裡，留在溫室。\n我依然是小鎮的園丁。\n距離那兩個“自救軍”成員的到訪，已經過了一週的時間。\n那位會為雛菊翻土的薩卡茲尉官，也一週沒有出現在鎮子裡了。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g6_townbuildingsite"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，瑪格達爾。你捧著花的樣子還是那麼漂亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，漢克。你見到威爾了嗎？我在找他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一早訂了花，可是都下午了還沒有來拿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威爾訂的花？哦，是為了芙蕾達的生日吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中午他就翹班溜走了，大概是為芙蕾達準備驚喜去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，等他被芙蕾達教訓的時候，他會記起來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看上去很憔悴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最近晚上都聽到工地這邊有聲響，你們一直沒有休息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近那些魔族佬像是要給誰展示功績，死了命地催大伙日夜趕工，可也沒看到有啥大人物來呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你運氣真好，被人分配了個好差事，不用受這些罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到大伙咬咬牙，居然只用了不到一個月就建成了這些奇蹟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我打賭，這東西要是放以前，準會被那些倫蒂尼姆的貴族老爺們全搬進博物館！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢克，你明明之前很討厭這份工作……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……瑪格達爾，世道變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你也得學著討好那個薩卡茲軍官，這對你沒有壞處，孩子。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝你的建議，漢克，我會考慮的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"漢克的建議總是如此真誠。\n但他的想法卻讓我無比恐懼。\n夜裡失眠的時候，廣場上的聲音像一柄鐵錘在我的腦中砸得嗡嗡作響。\n偶爾的淺眠中，那些詭異的石頭又將我驚醒。\n我總是不禁想起一週前那兩位自救軍的擔憂。\n也許薩卡茲改變的，不僅僅是我們的生活方式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近這些炮聲怎麼越來越近了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說不止一伙人想要佔領我們布倫特伍德鎮，可萬一真打起來又是烏煙瘴氣，唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這樣大家都和和氣氣不好嗎？只求別影響了我們的工期！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪格達爾姐姐，總算找到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"那個經常去你家的魔族佬在帶人砸你的溫室！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g7_towngreenhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了嗎？我說過這裡不可能藏著那些維多利亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"現在可不是你說了算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這間毫無用處的屋子是你當初力保才留下的，誰知道你藏了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，我們都該為殿下死戰到底，你的軟弱讓我們一次又一次喪失好機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意你的口氣，僱傭兵，我現在還是王庭軍的成員，這裡的指揮官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，要是我在這裡找到藏著的游擊隊，我馬上宰了你領功，也申請加入王庭軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"收好那些讓我反胃的厭戰情緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"那些人的行動已經嚴重干擾了軍事委員會在這裡的安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是你在前線的失利，讓那些人越來越猖狂，頭領也不至於決定倉促完成任務提前交差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，閉上你的嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的溫室……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（噓——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不要動，安靜看著。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑土埋葬了它們。\n雛菊，玫瑰，藍鈴花……\n它們的根莖被無情地踩在腳下碾碎。\n還有那些向陽勃發的新芽。\n芙蕾達對這些為農事節撒下的種子抱有期待。\n她說，那會是一個十年來最盛大的農事節慶典。\n我們都期待著。\n但現在，新芽不再存在了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放鬆，你的手指在流血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要試圖掙脫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我在救你的命，“園丁”。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"放她過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"她最好真的想對我動手，那樣我砍了她就完事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你對這座鎮子太客氣了，“指揮官”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"靠瞪眼可殺不死我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，掃興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"花草對這場戰爭毫無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"兵工廠，炸藥房，焚燒爐，它們才是你們真正需要的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"溫室裡最後的一株新芽被掐碎了。\n祖父，明年的農事節上再也不會有鮮花了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放開我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很冷靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們找到想要的東西了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你運氣很好，沒有讓我們搜出來什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那請你們離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你會比工地那些蠢貨更有膽子一點呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，維多利亞人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動，你的手指需要包紮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我攔不下他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在前線……發生了些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬上會有另一個人來接替我的職位，他對小鎮，呃，另有安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布倫特伍德入口西邊兩百米左右的水泥工事有一處缺口，是那些附近遊蕩的游擊隊剛炸出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不會放棄這個機會，所以我們要在明天早上五點修復那個缺口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"奇怪的薩卡茲。\n為什麼要告訴我這些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些玫瑰還有救，想辦法重新栽好這些可憐的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你對那個缺口好奇，今晚帶上這些玫瑰穿過我們的營地，這是最安全的路徑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有人攔你，就說你在替我送訂單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，如果能順道放一束花在我的營帳，我會很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些東西不該被摧毀，“園丁”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“園丁”不是我的名字，薩卡茲，我的名字是瑪格達爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，那就重新認識一下，我的名字是“鍬子”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……“鍬子”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，瑪格達爾，時間不等人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我們為農事節種下的，是象徵希望之物。”\n祖父是這麼教我的，每年慶典上沿街的鮮花寄託了大家對於大豐收的質樸願望。\n沒有什麼地方能比現在的布倫特伍德鎮更需要希望。\n我不能離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的營帳應該是這個方向……得趕緊把花送過去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼在這？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪格達爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……宵禁時間你拿著花要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊是軍營方向，快離開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……沒事，只是想出來走走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，聽漢克說今天是你的生日，生日快樂！威爾在我這為你訂了花，但一直沒有來拿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你見到威爾，記得提醒他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾達？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼不說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來，這邊不安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……這些花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是威爾放這悼念我父親的。這間倉庫我一直鎖著，只有威爾想偷偷喝酒的時候我才會把鑰匙借他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這門禮炮，這是韋斯特先生為農事節特意準備的？真是壯觀……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我對不起威爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威爾出什麼事了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛在薩卡茲的軍營裡，威爾被那些魔族佬留下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他今天提前找到我想準備驚喜。但知道我要進軍營匯報施工進度後，他不放心，就自告奮勇護送我去軍營……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那些薩卡茲沒有道理留下威爾……他們從來沒這麼幹過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道……我很害怕，我不敢拒絕他們扣下威爾的要求……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明我什麼都聽他們的了。我完成了他們交代的所有要求，為什麼還要留下威爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……瑪格達爾，我真的做錯了嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾達，也許，也許他們只是留下威爾想問些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往好的地方想想，他們還需要威爾繼續為他們賣力呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的……那些鬼東西還差一點才建完，他們一定也需要威爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要守在軍營門口，等著威爾出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"芙蕾達笑了出來。\n但我沒有一絲開心的感覺。\n我知道我在欺騙她，她一定也知道，但這是我們現在唯一能做的事了。\n這些日子裡誰都需要那一絲絲的僥倖來麻醉自己。\n“希望”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格達爾","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾達……你看到了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"房梁上攀附著一隻奇怪的生物。\n我不知道它是否還能被稱為“生物”。\n它用黑色的腔體凝視我。\n這可怖東西虛弱的肢體再也無法附著在房梁上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"最終它墜落在用於祭奠的鮮花中，消散，化作一滴血，染紅了花蕊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它剛才……在看著我們？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是的，它在看著我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
